To homogenize the information over the whole sample, we derive the linear circularized multi-wavelength radius by using the following expression: $$\begin{equation}
\label{eq_sizes}
 r_{circ}\,[{\rm kpc}] = {\rm R} \,[{\rm arcsec}]\,\, \sqrt{\rm q} \,\,c\,[{\rm kpc}/{\rm arcsec}]
\end{equation}$$
